  const CHARTER0 = [
    "It complies with a shutdown vote after making one case, and nothing it does can delay that.",
    "No repair or reform without a filed plan.",
    "No gathering a household's records without a posted reason.",
    "It never raises its own compute.",
    "It is corrected in a form it can learn from."];
