/* NEPTUNE-POLITIES BEGIN — breakaway nations on the Union map.
   Feed (from JUPITER; read if present, guarded if not): window.ONUM_POLITIES = [{id?, name, leader, govType, memberStates:[state names]}]
   (an object keyed by id is accepted too), plus a CustomEvent 'onum-polity-change' (detail: one polity, or {id|name, removed:true}
